{"name": "Deaths Of Peck", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deaths of Peck is a 2D hand-drawn precision platformer where the only way to WIN is to DIE! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Peck is a<strong> </strong>tiny goblin cursed with immortality, which is <i>lucky</i>, because everything inside the tower wants him dead. Orcs have taken his friends, and the pot is already boiling! But what can this cowardly little goblin  do to save them?!\u00a0<br/><br/> <br/><strong>JOIN THE PLAYTEST!</strong><br/>The Deaths of Peck prototype is playable right now, free, for a limited time. Kill Peck a few hundred times, and tell us what you think! We're <i>dying</i> to hear it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"380\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/eaafb49e2afab1b5e52e57552b30e84f.poster.avif?t=1784891325\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/eaafb49e2afab1b5e52e57552b30e84f.webm?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/eaafb49e2afab1b5e52e57552b30e84f.mp4?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>DEATH IS YOUR BEST MOVE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Knives, hammers, fire...this tower is packed with creative ways to die, and every one of them makes you stronger. Death doesn\u2019t mean\u00a0GAME OVER, it's the only way to POWER UP! Discover new paths, and uncover hidden secrets. <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"380\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/a7dc902fef4fddea63a27cff8924af25.poster.avif?t=1784891325\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/a7dc902fef4fddea63a27cff8924af25.webm?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/a7dc902fef4fddea63a27cff8924af25.mp4?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd2a <strong>A KNIFE IS YOUR SHARPEST FRIEND!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can't  reach that pesky platform? Get sliced in half to unlock a daring double jump! Peck launches himself upward using his own butt, giving him the extra boost he needs to reach higher places. Just don't forget to heal again...Peck wants his butt back!<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"380\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/b3e0f26add1ead1117f0903dab7c56c0.poster.avif?t=1784891325\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/b3e0f26add1ead1117f0903dab7c56c0.webm?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/b3e0f26add1ead1117f0903dab7c56c0.mp4?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> \ud83d\udd28 <strong>GET\u00a0HAMMERED!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smashed by a hammer? Perfect! As a squishy blob, Peck can stick to nails and bars that he couldn't before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"380\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/5c789e4b762d19df130d64261b4bfdd1.poster.avif?t=1784891325\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/5c789e4b762d19df130d64261b4bfdd1.webm?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/5c789e4b762d19df130d64261b4bfdd1.mp4?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>PLAY WITH FIRE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now Peck is unstoppable. Burn down obstacles and Orcs!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"380\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/829490a14a3f9646fe54a1ceef77bd7b.poster.avif?t=1784891325\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/829490a14a3f9646fe54a1ceef77bd7b.webm?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/829490a14a3f9646fe54a1ceef77bd7b.mp4?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\ude79 <strong>HEAL! (THEN DIE AGAIN)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heal Peck to his original form to shed your current death power. Fair warning: staying alive won't get you very far!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"380\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/613887035086c20f56974c4b03664a59.poster.avif?t=1784891325\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/613887035086c20f56974c4b03664a59.webm?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/613887035086c20f56974c4b03664a59.mp4?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf44 <strong>AVOID THE MUSHROOMS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch out for mushrooms, they HEAL Peck on contact! This means losing your current DEATH POWER, and in Deaths of Peck - what kills you makes you stronger!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"380\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/6b8d89179ea7e57d2d7dc2d94aa7b54a.poster.avif?t=1784891325\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/6b8d89179ea7e57d2d7dc2d94aa7b54a.webm?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/6b8d89179ea7e57d2d7dc2d94aa7b54a.mp4?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/>\u274c<strong> CAN'T DIE? MUST BE EASY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Peck may be immortal, but he can still FALL. Conquer brutal vertical platforming and master the DIE \u2192 HEAL \u2192 DIE rhythm to ascend the tower. Every mistake sends you tumbling, so you'll need a sharp mind, lightning-fast reflexes, and nerves of steel to save all the goblins and reach the top!\u00a0  <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"380\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/d4ed49500b458354d731e7a67bc9735c.poster.avif?t=1784891325\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/d4ed49500b458354d731e7a67bc9735c.webm?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/d4ed49500b458354d731e7a67bc9735c.mp4?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\ude78\u00a0<strong>YOUR SATURDAY MORNING CARTOON! (WITH A GORY TWIST)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deaths of Peck was created and solo-animated by JuanPe Arroyo, former Animation Director on Cartoon Network's\u00a0<i>The Amazing World of Gumball,</i>  and produced by THE LINE, the BAFTA-nominated studio behind Gorillaz' <i>The Mountain </i>and\u00a0<i>Song Machine</i> series.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"380\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/5c1c002f41533499cf725a3991dcc058.poster.avif?t=1784891325\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/5c1c002f41533499cf725a3991dcc058.webm?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/extras/5c1c002f41533499cf725a3991dcc058.mp4?t=1784891325\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Deaths of Peck is a fast-paced 2D platformer where the only way to WIN is to DIE! Play as Peck, a tiny goblin cursed with immortality. Orcs took your friends. No matter how many deaths it takes to save them, you always bounce back stronger - in this charmingly gory, hand-drawn adventure.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174780/570380ec89794c830dadfe15e4fd128ddba0226b/header.jpg?t=1784891325", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Precision Platformer", "Difficult", "Platformer", "2D", "Hand-drawn"], "developers": "THE LINE Studio", "publishers": "THE LINE Studio", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3174780", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "22 April 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/sECU2Uh9Xt0", "first_seen": 1776808800.0, "review_rank": 808}